        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Classroom Function Lever for Panic Device</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis is a  Classroom Function Lever (Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key)  is suitable for all Wide and Medium  Stile Doors \r\n(aluminum framed, hollow metal, or wood).  For use on door's exterior with <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Panic Device Hardware</b></a>.  Heavy duty commercial set covers standard 2-1/8\" bore hole door prep. Old Item# PDQ-629LPKH \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with PDQ <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-rim-exit-device-for-30-36-inch-door-pdq-6300r\"><b>6200 Series Rim Exit Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/passage-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-s-14-phl\"><b>Passage Function Lever for 6200 Series Panic Device</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/night-latch-lever-for-panic-device-pdq-6-sh-09-phl\"><b>Night Latch Function Lever for 6200 Series Panic Device</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPDQ Philadelphia style lever with round rose. Packaged with mounting hardware, instructions, and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for PDQ 6-SH-08-PHL Keyed Classroom Function Lever\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Classroom Function (ANSI F08) - Outside lever locked and unlocked by Key.</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard Schlage C Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 2 keys</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
